<title>CANADA: TABLE-ALBERTA AG FORECASTS 1997/98 CROP PRODUCTION.</title>
<headline>TABLE-ALBERTA AG FORECASTS 1997/98 CROP PRODUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alberta Agriculture on Wednesday forecast yields and production of its grain and oilseed crops for crop year 1997/98 (Aug/July).</p>
<p>CROP   1997 YIELD  10-YR-AVG  1997 EST. OUTPUT  HARVEST</p>
<p>	 bushel/acre   bu/ac    '000 tonnes	 pct swathed</p>
<p>Spring Wheat 37	 34.5    5,739.7		 0.3 pct</p>
<p>Oats	   69	 66.2    1,170.5		 0.6 pct</p>
<p>Barley	 56	 56.7    6,218.2		 0.7 pct</p>
<p>Winter Wheat 34	 34.6	 37.0		 8.0 pct</p>
<p>Fall Rye     37	 31.8	 37.6		14.0 pct</p>
<p>Peas	   36	 34.6	377.2		 2.0 pct</p>
<p>Canola	 23	 23.9    2,112.6		 2.0 pct</p>
<p>Flax	   18	 22.3	 32.0		 0.0 pct</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
</text>
